text:
As a Husband, a Father of a 2-year-old, and a Homeowner, I’m invested in the long-term success of El Cajon. Like you, I want to see:
Safer streets, sidewalks, parks, and playgrounds for our kids & neighbors; Higher wages & lower housing costs;
More thriving restaurants, grocery stores, shops, & businesses;
Less helicopter noise;
Fast resolution of public nuisances;
Responsible city spending without raising the sales tax rate.
